The Wind Waker runtime library reconstruction attribution

The sources in this directory (PowerPC_EABI_Support, TRK_MINNOW_DOLPHIN,
OdemuExi2, odenotstub, amcstubs), and the headers under include/tww, are copied
from the community decompilation of The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker:

  https://github.com/zeldaret/tww
  commit a1854d47ce5aa9d0f21c7fb5a71aaade63659693

That project is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0; its license text
is kept here as LICENSE.tww. Credit belongs to its contributors and to the
original Metrowerks and Nintendo authors. These are public reconstructions of
the Metrowerks Standard Library, runtime and debugger libraries, not an
original source release. Preserve upstream notices and comments.

Local changes reproduce the library versions linked into Medal of Honor:
Frontline. They were made with AI assistance; every modified file and the
evidence for each change are listed in docs/Runtime.md.
